<title>UK: UK Feb non-EU trade deficit 554 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Feb non-EU trade deficit 554 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office of National Statistics released following seasonally adjusted UK non-EU Trade data-</p>
<p>    UK TRADE NON-EU (in million stg)    Feb	Jan    (prev est)</p>
<p>    Trade balance			 -554     -339     (-398)</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)			 6,244    6,402   (6,357)</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)			 6,798    6,741   (6,755)</p>
<p>    Oil exports			     220	322     (322)</p>
<p>    Oil imports			     337	399     (401)</p>
<p>    Trade balance 3m ending Feb    -1,512	N/A  (-1,655)</p>
<p>NOTE - forecast -625 million stg deficit.</p>
</text>
